  "title": "Oozy Molten Egyptian Peas Tagine",
  "description": "A sour and molten Egyptian dish featuring peas, perfect for a lazy Sunday, made with a mortar and pestle and cooked on a hot stone plate, with anti-inflammatory properties.",
