  "instructions": [
    "Pound the garlic and ginger in a mortar until well combined.",
    "Heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the ground coriander and cumin and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Stir in the thawed peas, lemon juice, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a hot stone plate and cook for 10 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Use the mortar and pestle to mash some of the peas, creating a molten texture.",
    "Serve the oozy molten Egyptian peas tagine hot, garnished with fresh herbs if desired."
